{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307230/extras/364f16d68dab576d312c8763d541ca2b.avif?t=1773136580\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307230/extras_big/364f16d68dab576d312c8763d541ca2b.avif?t=1773136580 width=800 height=88 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307230/extras/28c8132ada9e0b17f32ce8b941184ebd.poster.avif?t=1773136580\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307230/extras/28c8132ada9e0b17f32ce8b941184ebd.webm?t=1773136580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You can escape the horrors that lurk in the dark... but never the ones you carry inside.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Crimson Apostle</i> is a narrative escape room set as a prequel to the novel <i>Dracula</i>. You play as Renfield, a man trapped between remorse and madness. To survive, you must solve puzzles, face disturbing visions, and overcome the trials imposed by the enigmatic Countess Dolingen of Gratz.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the origins of the most unsettling character in the <i>Dracula</i> mythos and uncover the horrors that shaped his fate. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307230/extras/23722076adf2746555db3ec8be0d2030.avif?t=1773136580\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307230/extras_big/23722076adf2746555db3ec8be0d2030.avif?t=1773136580 width=800 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307230/extras/56cf7f8d4a48d7f42ad2a7507577d6f9.poster.avif?t=1773136580\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307230/extras/56cf7f8d4a48d7f42ad2a7507577d6f9.webm?t=1773136580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve intricate puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate environments, solve riddles, and escape locked rooms using logic and observation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the visions that erode the protagonist\u2019s sanity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flee from creatures that can interrupt puzzles at any moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the origins of Dracula\u2019s mythical servant. Discover how ambition and madness led him to his fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307230/extras/1ade9337efcc956ad9163e781bfdb350.avif?t=1773136580\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307230/extras_big/1ade9337efcc956ad9163e781bfdb350.avif?t=1773136580 width=800 height=89 /></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3307230?t=1773136580","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307230/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773136580","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307230/2612951f7c8f0dedf382b573db1cc1857c8e2cd9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773136580","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co